The files in this folder are a TypeScript translation, with modifications, of
maskingtape 0.4.0, a Korean personal information detector:

  https://github.com/ChoHyeonChan/maskingtape (version 0.4.0)
  Copyright 2026 The maskingtape Authors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).

Translated: the rule pipeline (pipeline.py), the eleven rule detectors, the
input tidying (normalize.py), overlap merging (overlaps.py) and the mask and
label strategies. Not translated: the local LLM name detector (name_llm.py),
the command line (cli.py) and the pseudonym strategy (pseudonym.py).

Modifications: Python's re and str behaviour is rebuilt on JavaScript regular
expressions (regex.ts); conditional groups are rewritten as alternatives;
positions are reported in UTF-16 units; NameDetector's min_confidence option
and has_name_candidate are left out.
